From ffd81d3a7e1f3dff98ffa1d42827591d96051398 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local-patch <local@invalid>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:37:34 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] stream: guard ReadChan send/close so connection teardown
 never panics or deadlocks the tunnel reader

CacheTunnelMessage blocks (backpressure) only while the connection is open;
CloseReadChannel first releases blocked senders, then closes ReadChan once,
so DeleteLocalConnection cannot panic a sender (v1.23.0) nor deadlock on a
full ReadChan without consumer (kubeedge/kubeedge#6836 holds localConsLock
across the send).
